    {
      "name": "Lava Bound",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "traits",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The magma octopus can exist outside of lava for up to 1 hour each day. If it remains outside of lava for 1 minute or longer, its skin begins to dry and harden like rapidly-cooled magma. While its skin is hardened, it has a walking speed of 20 feet, an Armor Class of 18, and vulnerability to cold damage. If it remains outside of lava for 1 hour or longer, it becomes petrified, transforming into basalt. Its body returns to normal if it is submerged in lava for 1 round."
      ],
      "condition": {
        "name": "petrified",
        "duration": "1 minute",
        "repeatSave": null
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Lava Swimmer",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "traits",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "While in lava, the magma octopus has a swimming speed of 60 feet and can move through the lava as if it were water."
      ]
    },
    {
